_name_jianti_auto":"汴州","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c304388-db0e-11ef-a0e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"浚儀縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"浚仪县","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8c304389-db0e-11ef-9c65-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左傳：逢澤有介麋焉，宋地也。杜預註曰：地理志言逢澤在滎陽開封縣東北；遠，疑非。括地志曰：逢澤在汴州浚儀縣東南二十四里。帥，音率。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左传：逢泽有介麋焉，宋地也。杜预注曰：地理志言逢泽在荥阳开封县东北；远，疑非。括地志曰：逢泽在汴州浚仪县东南二十四里。帅，音率。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8c3027e3-db0e-11ef-811e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"逢澤","place_name_jianti_auto":"逢泽","resolved_place_entity_id":9335,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8c304391-db0e-11ef-a693-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《汲郡古文》：梁惠王发逢、忌之薮以赐民。《汉志》：开封有...","context_before":"...有介麋焉。逢泽去宋远。或曰：逢，犹遇也；泽，即宋之孟诸。","source_end_index":92,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d67f1290-24c6-5acf-b7bc-5294515f30b3","source_start_index":63,"source_text":"周显王二十六年，秦孝王使公子少官，帅师会诸侯于蓬泽以朝王。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1王致伯于秦，諸侯皆賀秦。秦孝公使公子少官帥師會諸侯于逢澤以朝王。","content_fanyi":"周显王封秦国国君为一方诸侯之长，各国诸侯都来向秦国祝贺。秦孝公派公子少官率军队在逢泽与诸侯相会，并朝见周显王。","content_jianti_auto":"1王致伯于秦，诸侯皆贺秦。秦孝公使公子少官帅师会诸侯于逢泽以朝王。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":162,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 二十六年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c3027e0-db0e-11ef-bf19-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-343},"tongjian_id":"8c3027e0-db0e-11ef-bf19-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"place_name":"逢澤"},"message":"success","success":true}